'''Wizardman''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}}. He also appears during {{NPCSprite|Detective Amog}}'s reverse-murder quest and in the {{zone|Wizardman Bureau}} after saying {{Code|Help Wizardman!}} in chat.

== Quests ==
'''Wizardman''' first appears in the {{Zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}}, where he instructs the player to say "Help Wizardman!" in chat to receive his help later on.

=== Reverse Murder ===
Towards the end of {{NPCSprite|Detective Amog}}'s reverse-murder quest, he tasks the player with shouting "Help Wizardman!". Doing so will make '''Wizardman''' appear and help destroy the wall that {{NPCSprite|Ramero}} put up around the {{Zone|Murder House}}.

=== Trials ===
Upon saying "Help Wizardman!" in the {{zone|Wizardman Bureau}}, '''Wizardman''' will appear and allow the player to compete with him in {{Green|3}} different trials. Each trial can be attempted an unlimited number of times.

==== {{blue|Temporal Race}} ====
<blockquote><span style="font-size:larger;">{{gray|''Face Wizardman in a parkour trial.''}}</span></blockquote>
The player must race against '''Wizardman''' in parkour. During the race, rewind buttons appear long the track. Punching a rewind button rewinds '''Wizardman<nowiki>'s</nowiki>''' location to where they were several seconds ago. Completing the trial rewards {{Item|Ugly Boots Fragment|amount=1}}.

==== {{red|Wizard Brawl}} ====
<blockquote><span style="font-size:larger;">{{gray|''Face Wizardman in a combat trial.''}}</span></blockquote>
The player is teleported to the {{zone|Wizard Brawl}} and has to defeat '''Wizardman''' in combat. They are given a {{Item|Staff of the Rising Moon}} to damage him with. '''Wizardman''' has {{stat|hearts|12}} during the trial. The player can also press the jump button twice to fly.

Once the player is ready, they can use the {{Item|Staff of the Rising Moon}} damage '''Wizardman'''. Hitting '''Wizardman''' with a projectile removes {{stat|hearts|1}} from him. Falling into lava or getting hit by a projectile from '''Wizardman''' deals {{stat|hearts|1}} to the player. Completing the trial rewards {{Item|W Logo Fragment|amount=1}}.

==== {{Yellow|Quad Link Legacy}} ====
<blockquote><span style="font-size:larger;">''{{gray|Face Wizardman in an epic battle of wits.}}''</span></blockquote>
The player must play [[w:Connect Four|Connect Four]] against '''Wizardman'''. Completing the trial rewards {{Item|Tight Pants Fragment|amount=1}}.

==== Wizard Face Reward ====
Using the rewards from the trials, the player can craft {{Item|Ugly Boots}}, {{Item|Wizardman Leggings}}, and {{Item|W Logo}}. Wearing these while speaking to '''Wizardman''' awards the player with a {{Item|Wizard Face}}.

By speaking to Wizardman while wearing the face, a cutscene triggers, which ends with the player at the top of {{Zone|The Mountaintop}} next to {{NPCSprite|Defunct Wizardman}}.

