==Trivia== 
* Aliases for {{Code|Help Wizardman!}} include {{Code|Help Wizardman}} and other combinations with varying capitalized letters.
* '''Wizardman''' disappears forever in the player's current lobby once they trigger '''Wizardman'''<nowiki/>'s first interaction dialogue. They will re-appear in a new lobby, however.
* During the final dialogue, after wearing the {{Item|Wizard Face}} and talking to the '''Wizardman''', a cutscene plays, where the [[Player]] can be seen performing the activities mentioned by '''Wizardman'''.
** Once the dialogue and cutscene come to end, the player finds themselves near the top of the {{Zone|The Mountaintop}}, next to [[Defunct Wizardman]] and is granted the {{AchievementLink|Top of the Wizard food chain|ach=1}}.

